config TOUCHSCREEN_FTS1BA90A
	tristate "STMicroelectronics FTS1BA90A touchscreen"
	depends on I2C
	select INPUT_SEC_CMD
	help
	  Say Y here to enable support for the STMicroelectronics
	  FTS1BA90A FingerTipS touchscreen used on Samsung devices.

	  If unsure, say N.
